      "title": "固定模型输入",
      "payload": {
        "messages": {
          "system": "BrickAtlas grid-v1: x,z use studs (8 mm), y uses plate heights (3.2 mm).\nPart position is the MINIMUM x,z corner and BOTTOM y. turn is 0,1,2,3 quarter-turns:\nodd turns swap catalog w,d; 180-degree symmetric bricks have equal footprints.\nAll bricks/plates are opaque rectangular bodies with top studs and bottom sockets.\nOnly integer coordinates 0..24 and at most 64 pieces; bodies must fit within [0,32]^3.\nNo overlap. Every elevated part needs at least one directly supporting stud below it.\nOnly vertical +Y removal and -Y insertion are allowed in plan tasks; overhead overlap blocks passage.\nThis is discrete geometry/connectivity, NOT force, stability or robot-control simulation.\nProgram output: {\"version\":1,\"parts\":[{\"id\":\"p1\",\"partId\":\"3005\",\"color\":\"red\",\"x\":0,\"y\":0,\"z\":0,\"turn\":0}]}.\nAlternative reversible output: {\"version\":1,\"nodes\":[{\"id\":\"p1\",\"partId\":\"3005\",\"color\":\"red\",\n\"parent\":null,\"offset\":[0,0,0],\"turn\":0}, ...]}.\nRelative offsets are in GLOBAL grid axes from parent's minimum corner; turn remains absolute.\nParents must occur earlier. This relative program is not a guarantee of a stud attachment.\nReturn exactly one JSON object; no markdown or chain of thought.\nPublic catalog: {\"2456\":{\"name\":\"Brick 2x6\",\"w\":6,\"d\":2,\"h\":3},\"3001\":{\"name\":\"Brick 2x4\",\"w\":4,\"d\":2,\"h\":3},\"3002\":{\"name\":\"Brick 2x3\",\"w\":3,\"d\":2,\"h\":3},\"3003\":{\"name\":\"Brick 2x2\",\"w\":2,\"d\":2,\"h\":3},\"3004\":{\"name\":\"Brick 1x2\",\"w\":2,\"d\":1,\"h\":3},\"3005\":{\"name\":\"Brick 1x1\",\"w\":1,\"d\":1,\"h\":3},\"3007\":{\"name\":\"Brick 2x8\",\"w\":8,\"d\":2,\"h\":3},\"3008\":{\"name\":\"Brick 1x8\",\"w\":8,\"d\":1,\"h\":3},\"3009\":{\"name\":\"Brick 1x6\",\"w\":6,\"d\":1,\"h\":3},\"3010\":{\"name\":\"Brick 1x4\",\"w\":4,\"d\":1,\"h\":3},\"3020\":{\"name\":\"Plate 2x4\",\"w\":4,\"d\":2,\"h\":1},\"3021\":{\"name\":\"Plate 2x3\",\"w\":3,\"d\":2,\"h\":1},\"3022\":{\"name\":\"Plate 2x2\",\"w\":2,\"d\":2,\"h\":1},\"3023\":{\"name\":\"Plate 1x2\",\"w\":2,\"d\":1,\"h\":1},\"3024\":{\"name\":\"Plate 1x1\",\"w\":1,\"d\":1,\"h\":1},\"3031\":{\"name\":\"Plate 4x4\",\"w\":4,\"d\":4,\"h\":1},\"3032\":{\"name\":\"Plate 4x6\",\"w\":6,\"d\":4,\"h\":1},\"3034\":{\"name\":\"Plate 2x8\",\"w\":8,\"d\":2,\"h\":1},\"3035\":{\"name\":\"Plate 4x8\",\"w\":8,\"d\":4,\"h\":1},\"3460\":{\"name\":\"Plate 1x8\",\"w\":8,\"d\":1,\"h\":1},\"3622\":{\"name\":\"Brick 1x3\",\"w\":3,\"d\":1,\"h\":3},\"3623\":{\"name\":\"Plate 1x3\",\"w\":3,\"d\":1,\"h\":1},\"3666\":{\"name\":\"Plate 1x6\",\"w\":6,\"d\":1,\"h\":1},\"3710\":{\"name\":\"Plate 1x4\",\"w\":4,\"d\":1,\"h\":1},\"3795\":{\"name\":\"Plate 2x6\",\"w\":6,\"d\":2,\"h\":1}}\nNo tools or target feedback are available on the one-shot track. Follow task-specific response schema.",
          "user": "{\"id\":\"976f466d1c3e17c8b0cad614\",\"kind\":\"reconstruct\",\"split\":\"test_ood\",\"family\":\"narrow-lattice\",\"prompt\":\"Reconstruct all reference pieces and their exact colors/poses from the assembled and layer-inspection images. Layer views explicitly reveal hidden geometry; this is NOT single-view reconstruction. IDs may be arbitrary.\",\"input\":{\"billOfMaterials\":{\"3035:gray\":1,\"3005:yellow\":2,\"3004:red\":1,\"3005:blue\":2,\"3004:green\":2,\"3023:yellow\":1,\"3023:red\":2,\"3004:yellow\":1,\"3004:blue\":1,\"3005:green\":1},\"coordinateFrame\":\"minimum x/z corner at 0,0; bottom y=0\",\"condition\":\"layers\",\"coordinateSystem\":\"min X/Z corner anchored at 0; X/Z studs, Y plate layers\"},\"responseSchema\":{\"version\":1,\"parts\":[{\"id\":\"local1\",\"partId\":\"3005\",\"color\":\"red\",\"x\":0,\"y\":0,\"z\":0,\"turn\":0}]},\"imageTitles\":[\"Reference: assembled isometric\",\"Reference layer inspection: only parts with bottom y=0. All other layers removed.\",\"Reference layer inspection: only parts with bottom y=1. All other layers removed.\",\"Reference layer inspection: only parts with bottom y=2. All other layers removed.\",\"Reference layer inspection: only parts with bottom y=4. All other layers removed.\",\"Reference layer inspection: only parts with bottom y=7. All other layers removed.\",\"Reference layer inspection: only parts with bottom y=10. All other layers removed.\"]}"
